        Kriteria filter Anda terlalu spesifik. Coba turunkan jarak tempuh minimal, perbesar budget, atau klik tombol di bawah untuk mereset seluruh filter.
      </p>
    </div>
    <button
      type="button"
      id="empty-reset-filters-btn"
      class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-cyan-600 text-white font-bold text-xs shadow-md hover:bg-cyan-500 transition cursor-pointer"
    >
      Reset Semua Filter
    </button>
  </div>

  <!-- STATE URL PAGINATION CONTROLS -->
  <div id="catalog-pagination-container" class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 border-t border-slate-200/60 dark:border-white/10 pt-6">
    <div class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-medium" id="pagination-status-counter">
      Halaman 1
    </div>

    <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5" id="pagination-buttons-wrapper">
      <!-- Buttons dynamically injected via JS -->
    </div>
